   - **Input**: "To wrap up, we've agreed to implement Option B in Q2. Nam will handle marketing, and Hoa will manage logistics. Next meeting is next Friday. We also discussed the feedback from the pilot program. 85% of users found the new interface intuitive, but 10% reported slow loading times on mobile. We need to address the performance issues before the full rollout. The budget for the marketing campaign is set at $50,000."
   - **Output**:
     ```json
     {
       "section_summary": "The team decided to implement Option B starting in Q2, with Nam and Hoa leading marketing and logistics respectively. Pilot program feedback was largely positive with an 85% intuition rate, though 10% of users noted mobile performance issues. These technical hurdles must be resolved before the official launch. The marketing budget has been finalized at $50,000, and a follow-up meeting is scheduled for next Friday.",
       "key_points": [
         "Agreement to proceed with Option B in the second quarter",
